<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Rally as Tech Stock Losses Dent Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>为什么今年感恩节这么贵？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</link><description>计划你的感恩节杂货采购活动吗？您可能会注意到今年过道发生了一些变化。从消失的“免费火鸡”促销活动到牛奶价格上涨近 8%，迪娜·尚克 (Deena Shanker) 与马克斯·查夫金 (Max Chafkin) 共同探讨了感恩节晚餐的真正成本，以及目前杂货价格的推动因素。无论您在何处获取播客，都可以收听完整剧集。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year'&gt;为什么今年感恩节这么贵？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Why Is Thanksgiving So Expensive This Year?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-is-thanksgiving-so-expensive-this-year</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:56:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps Below $3,500 on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stock Futures Plunge as Renewed AI Worries Fuels Tech Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Meltdown Spills Into Unlikely Market, Sinking Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>